                            </div>
                            <pre class="p-6 text-sm leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="tc">$ </span>curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:9090/api/v1/routes \
  -H <span class="ts">"X-Api-Key: your-secret-api-key"</span> \
  -H <span class="ts">"Content-Type: application/json"</span> \
  -d <span class="ts">'{
    "from": "api.example.com/v2/*",
    "to": "http://127.0.0.1:8080"
  }'</span></code></pre>
                        </div>
