                            <pre class="p-6 text-sm leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="tc">$ </span>curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:9090/api/v1/apps/myapp/deploy \
  -H <span class="ts">"X-Api-Key: your-secret-api-key"</span>

<span class="tc">{</span>
  <span class="tf">"status"</span>: <span class="ts">"deploying"</span>,
